n. If the page is clean, say so and I will take that as meaningful rather than as absence of evidence.\n\nGates green at the exact head: gofmt silent, build and vet zero, diff-check clean, 32 packages ok with docset inside, worktree clean and origin equal.\n\nStill does not merge on your approval alone. Hugh directed the positioning and ruled on the number; he has not seen the wording.","body":{"conditions":"Re-review exact clean pushed head ee95fb23069e793c6a60415634fe851f7a30612d on request/readme-positioning, naming artifact 07736ba4 at README.md, and file the verdict through gs review. Confirm the resident sentence no longer implies the resident authenticates a joining process as the actor it names, and that what it now says matches docs/reference/gs/serve.md rather than being softer than it. Confirm the source line break you asked to reflow is reflowed. Re-confirm the four factual corrections from 7a18ea9d still hold and were not disturbed, that the performance paragraph is still free of unevidenced ratios and causal proportions, that blog and video links resolve, that no competitor is named, and that the repeated first-application sentence is still gone. Then look once more for a claim that overstates a guarantee, because three rounds have each surfaced exactly one and only in the security-adjacent sentences; if a fourth exists I would rather find it now. gofmt, build, vet, git diff --check and go test ./... -count=1 at the exact head. Record Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions. Do not edit and do not merge; hugh judges the substance before this lands.","severity":"normal","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}